  "description": "This is a collection of short stories that depict the passion and romance of boy's love. Each couple go through different conflicts together that test their feelings for one another. A collection of boy's love webtoon ranging from romantic comedy to a murder mystery!\n\n1-3. **Margaret Buinui Bimilgongbang** (마거릿 부인의 비밀공방, Lady Margaret's Secret Workshop) \\[Eoreunyongsatang & Yulseo\\]\nGenius jeweller Jen works at Lady Margaret's Secret Workshop in exchange for “something” only the madame can offer. But what is that something...?\n\n4-6. **Love and fever** (Love and fever, Love and fever) \\[Yeoing\\]\nHayoon asks his lover Junwoo to take of his shift at his part-time job, but Junwoo realizes what condition Hayoon is in and goes to visit him. As soon as the door opens... Hayoon is definitely in a strange state!\n\n7-9. **Maid Yeonswae Sarinsageon** (메이드 연쇄 살인사건, Mass Maid Murderer) \\[Gojo\\]\nIn a world like 19th Century England, with no specified gender roles much like the real world, the age of the employee began, but there's a serial killer on the loose that only targets male maids! In order to solve the cases, Russel employs the maid Elliot...\n\n10-12. **Dalkomsalbeolhan Geu Mueonga** (달콤살벌한 그 무언가, Sweet and Freaky/Sweet but Bloodly) \\[Wangsaeuchyobap\\]\nYoohan isn't family nor lover to Anjae, yet he provides him with warm food and a warm home. Anjae begins to slowly contemplate over his relationship with Yoohan...\n\n13-15. **Nege Ppajin Jeom** (네게 빠진 점, Why I'm Into You/The Mark I Fell For) \\[Lemi\\]\nSiyeon may be weak for beauties wih tear moles, but he's too weak when meeting with the perfectly ideal Eunha! What does he do? He can't stop thinking about Eunha!\n\n16-20. **unfixable** (unfixable, unfixable) \\[Innin\\]\n21-23. **Naega Iljiniya?** (내가 일진이야?, Am I the Bully?/I'm the Top Dog?) \\[Kkomi & Etoe)\n24-26. **Isanghyang** (이상향, The Perfect Scent/Aromatic Romance) \\[Dona\\]\n\n(Source: INKR & Copin Comics)",
